WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.661
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind energy-saving technology.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:10.849
Energy-efficient bulb: uses less electricity for similar light. Switch off: saves

00:00:10.849 --> 00:00:13.595
power when a device is not needed.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:19.761
Solar charger: uses energy from sunlight. Proper maintenance: helps devices work

00:00:19.761 --> 00:00:23.623
efficiently. Reuse: can reduce waste from usable equipment.

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:29.139
Create a class safety demonstration. Show a good example of energy-efficient bulb and

00:00:29.139 --> 00:00:32.386
switch off and explain why the good practice matters.
